{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/mongodb/mongodb-community-server","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:19:55.807Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/mongodb/mongodb-community-server/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/mongodb/mongodb-community-server"},"readme":"# MongoDB Community Server\n## Non-slim image deprecation\nThe non-slim images will be considered deprecated as of December 1st. We will continue publishing them for the near future, but we will eventually switch all images to slim.\n\nSlim images depend on ubi-micro instead of ubi, which reduces risk of outdated system packages that may trigger security scanners.\n\nTo switch to slim images, append *-slim* to the image tag. For example, if you are using *8.3.8-ubi8*, switching to *8.3.8-ubi8-slim* will switch to the slim image.\n\n## Ubuntu and ubi8 deprecation\nUbuntu images and ubi8 images will be deprecated on December 1st and will stop receiving system security updates after that date. Please switch to ubi9-slim images before that date to continue to receive system security updates.\n\n## Quick Reference\n- Maintained by:\n  [MongoDB](https://www.mongodb.com/)\n- Where to get help:\n  [MongoDB Documentation](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/), [MongoDB Community](https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/), [Technical Support](https://support.mongodb.com/?_ga=2.160125560.455708262.1673982856-741025604.1637357550)\n\n## Getting Started:\nPlease visit our [getting started guide](https://www.mongodb.com/compatibility/docker)\n\n## License\nView [full license information](https://www.mongodb.com/legal/licensing/server-side-public-license) for the software contained in this image","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"frederickferby","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/mongodb","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2022-09-23T16:30:29.064077Z","updated":"2026-09-25T06:56:03.470629Z","categories":["Integration & delivery","Databases & storage"],"keywor